set/2064/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_CircleCI.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2064/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_CircleCI.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2064/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_CircleCI.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2064/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_CircleCI.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2064/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_CircleCI.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2064/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_CircleCI.jpg","Software delivery has become a continuous loop. A single workflow brings source code through an automated build to functionality and compatibility testing, and finally to deployment—a process that repeats frequently. As the leading cloud-based platform for the automated building, testing and deployment of new code, CircleCI expedites this process and reduces risk by ensuring that code pushed to production is stable code.\r\n\r\nDevelopers can be a very particular bunch, but they have shown their faith in CircleCI with their time, energy and money. No developer wants to push a bug to an end user, and CircleCI helps reduce that risk by ensuring that code pushed to production is stable. By managing and running all of the necessary infrastructure, CircleCI saves precious time and allows developers to focus on releasing the next killer feature.","With killer features that charm developers, CircleCI is the leading cloud-based platform for the automated building, testing and deployment of new code.","CircleCI - IVP Portfolio Companies - Software Venture Capital","CircleCI - IVP Portfolio Companies  ","The leading continuous integration and delivery platform for software innovation at scale",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"155","2020-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/co